<title>USA: Nalco Chemical opens plant in China.</title>
<headline>Nalco Chemical opens plant in China.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nalco Chemical Co said Friday it opened a $3.5 million manufacturing facility, warehouse and distribution center in China.</p>
<p>The facility is in Suzhou, Jiangsu Province, 70 miles west of Shanghai.</p>
<p>This is the latest action of a cooperative joint venture between Nalco and CITIC Chemicals, a wholly owned subsidiary of the China International Trust and Investment Corp. The joint venture, named Nalco Chemical (Suzhou) Co Ltd, was formed in April 1995.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
